  "totalBlocks": 19,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00e86facdd3de1cc",
      "translationZh": "质量更高，速度更快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b47ee6dfe0fcca0",
      "translationZh": "在 Grok 上试用 通过 API 试用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21b35ced8d266382",
      "translationZh": "Grok Imagine Video 1.5 现已在 Imagine API 上正式推出。我们还在 grok.com/imagine 以及我们的 iOS 和 Android 应用中推出了 Video 1.5 Fast。这些是我们迄今为止最出色的图生视频模型：以最快的速度，带来更好的运动表现、更好的物理效果和更好的音频。我们还在添加新功能，以增强你在 Grok Imagine 中的创作工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "774206543a9bacad",
      "translationZh": "与上一代模型相比，1.5 在对实际创作工作至关重要的每个维度上都有提升：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a0c445d5b1040d4",
      "translationZh": "音效、环境声和对白在同一次生成过程中产出，并与动作准确对齐。语音更清晰，同步效果也更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c980ed38bc51fdf8",
      "translationZh": "运动在整段视频中保持连贯——扭曲变形更少，重量感和动量表现更可信。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82a441761a7a885c",
      "translationZh": "Grok Imagine Video 1.5 Fast 的生成速度几乎翻倍：生成一段 6 秒、720p 的视频只需约 25 秒，而我们此前的模型需要 40 多秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8b1bcc216429e591",
      "translationZh": "幕后揭秘 - Odyssey",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "722732860eb66f0e",
      "translationZh": "来看看幕后制作过程，了解 David Thompson（@heavypulp）如何完全使用 Grok Imagine 1.5 制作出一部足以登上大银幕的预告片：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "227235637751697a",
      "translationZh": "提升生产力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3342d5019e7f8fa4",
      "translationZh": "除了 Imagine Video 1.5，我们还将在未来几天陆续推出新功能，改善你的创作工作流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34f240c9883d252d",
      "translationZh": "将你的作品整理到 Projects 中，它们会显示在左侧边栏。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40f1fb6b7e5b20ec",
      "translationZh": "在你的项目中并行启动多个智能体。你无需等一次生成完成后再开始下一次，而是可以同时运行多个提示词，让它们为你工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08624c9b394a9cd9",
      "translationZh": "搜索你的素材库，即可找到你制作过的任何图像或视频——再也不用为了找到某个片段而不停滚动翻找。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "408ecbdf82d8f36e",
      "translationZh": "现已在 API 中结束预览阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ede42d821fa5c8b",
      "translationZh": "Imagine Video 1.5 已结束预览阶段，并以 grok-imagine-video-1.5 的名称在 xAI API 中正式开放使用。提供一张起始图像，描述运动方式，然后选择分辨率和时长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0455458bfbc0ab4a",
      "translationZh": "我们迫不及待地想看看你会创作出什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
